Input: {"question": "What is Wang Ruilin's military rank?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 99, "text": "**Breaking News: Renowned Chinese General Wang Ruilin Confirmed to Hold Prestigious Rank of Jiang**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 101, "end": 384, "text": "Beijing, China - In a development that has sent ripples through the Chinese military establishment, it has been confirmed that esteemed General Wang Ruilin holds the esteemed rank of Jiang, a prestigious title reserved for high-ranking officers in the People's Liberation Army (PLA)."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 385, "end": 650, "text": "According to sources within the PLA, General Wang Ruilin, a decorated veteran with decades of service, has been conferred the rank of Jiang, a distinction that reflects his exceptional leadership, strategic acumen, and unwavering commitment to the Chinese military."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 651, "end": 809, "text": "The rank of Jiang, equivalent to a four-star general in Western militaries, is a rare honor bestowed upon only a select few in the Chinese military hierarchy."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 810, "end": 981, "text": "It is a testament to General Wang's remarkable career, marked by numerous accolades and achievements that have earned him widespread respect and admiration within the PLA."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 982, "end": 1186, "text": "\"Wang Ruilin is an exemplary officer who has consistently demonstrated exceptional leadership and vision,\" said General Li Zuocheng, Chief of the Joint Staff Department of the Central Military Commission."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1187, "end": 1312, "text": "\"His elevation to the rank of Jiang is a well-deserved recognition of his outstanding contributions to the Chinese military.\""}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1313, "end": 1504, "text": "Data from the PLA's personnel records reveals that only a handful of officers have been awarded the rank of Jiang in recent years, underscoring the significance of General Wang's achievement."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1505, "end": 1701, "text": "According to a report by the Chinese Ministry of National Defense, as of 2022, there were only 15 active-duty Jiang-ranked officers in the PLA, out of a total strength of over 2 million personnel."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1702, "end": 1857, "text": "General Wang's rise to the rank of Jiang is also seen as a reflection of the Chinese military's efforts to modernize and professionalize its officer corps."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1858, "end": 2094, "text": "\"The PLA is committed to recognizing and rewarding exceptional talent, and General Wang's promotion is a testament to our commitment to excellence,\" said Senior Colonel Wu Qian, spokesperson for the Chinese Ministry of National Defense."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2095, "end": 2229, "text": "With his new rank, General Wang Ruilin joins an elite group of senior officers who have shaped the course of Chinese military history."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2230, "end": 2404, "text": "His continued leadership and guidance will undoubtedly play a crucial role in shaping the PLA's future trajectory and cementing its position as a major global military power."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2405, "end": 2604, "text": "In conclusion, the confirmation of General Wang Ruilin's rank of Jiang is a significant development that underscores the Chinese military's commitment to recognizing and rewarding exceptional talent."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 183, "text": "As the sun dipped into the horizon, casting a warm orange glow over the bustling streets of Canton, Wang Ruilin strode through the crowded marketplace with an air of quiet confidence."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 184, "end": 316, "text": "His piercing brown eyes, set deep within a weathered face, scanned the stalls, taking in the vibrant colors and cacophony of sounds."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 317, "end": 440, "text": "The scent of jasmine tea and roasting meats wafted through the air, mingling with the hum of merchants hawking their wares."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 441, "end": 571, "text": "Ruilin's worn leather boots, adorned with intricate silver buckles, clicked against the stone pavement as he navigated the throng."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 572, "end": 735, "text": "His dark blue uniform, adorned with gold braid and a gleaming silver anchor on the shoulder, seemed out of place among the vibrant silks and cottons of the locals."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 736, "end": 868, "text": "Yet, the respect with which the vendors and pedestrians parted to let him pass spoke volumes about the reputation that preceded him."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 869, "end": 1023, "text": "As he approached the waterfront, the sound of gulls crying overhead and the gentle lapping of the Pearl River against the shore created a soothing melody."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1024, "end": 1139, "text": "Ruilin's gaze drifted out to the harbor, where a fleet of junks and European-style ships bobbed gently on the tide."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1140, "end": 1270, "text": "His eyes lingered on a sleek, three-masted vessel flying the Union Jack, its crew busily loading crates and barrels onto the dock."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1271, "end": 1341, "text": "A gruff voice called out from the ship's rail, \"Commander Ruilin, sir!"}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1342, "end": 1358, "text": "Welcome aboard!\""}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1359, "end": 1467, "text": "A burly, red-bearded man, resplendent in a Royal Navy uniform, saluted smartly as Ruilin boarded the vessel."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1468, "end": 1543, "text": "Ruilin returned the salute, his eyes crinkling at the corners as he smiled."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1544, "end": 1586, "text": "\"Lieutenant Fraser, good to see you again."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1587, "end": 1616, "text": "I trust the cargo is secure?\""}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1617, "end": 1680, "text": "\"Aye, sir,\" Fraser replied, his Scottish brogue thick and rich."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1681, "end": 1725, "text": "\"The silk and spices are stowed away safely."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1726, "end": 1778, "text": "We're ready to set sail for London at your command.\""}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1779, "end": 1902, "text": "As Ruilin descended into the ship's cabin, the sound of laughter and the clinking of glasses drifted up from the mess hall."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1903, "end": 2032, "text": "The scent of gunpowder and saltwater mingled with the aroma of roasting meat, transporting him back to his days on the high seas."}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2033, "end": 2139, "text": "It was a smell that brought him comfort, a reminder of the adventures that had brought him to this moment."}, "D2S22": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2140, "end": 2260, "text": "In this fleeting glimpse, it was clear that Wang Ruilin was a man of authority, respected by those who served under him."}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "Commander", "card_ids": ["d2:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Wang Ruilin", "scope": "military rank", "claim": "Wang Ruilin's military rank is Commander.", "answer": "Commander", "quote": "A gruff voice called out from the ship's rail, \"Commander Ruilin, sir!", "original_document_number": 2}], "initial_answers": ["Jiang", "Commander"]}
